      "text": "The intervention will enhance creep performance relative to the Ni-free, unaged alloy.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Ni-free, unaged Al0.8NbTiV baseline does not exhibit controlled sigma precipitation.",
